75502894", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982460_558098478836227_2195642163881727498_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=iADm1zth_QkQ7kNvwGqhSZe&_nc_oc=AdqRnhQUQg-Ms6RVOhC3ZFAl3mVm4-R1f8Mx8NMyYQRGca14jwNemqKZtAJ88-gEN-I&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af1424bTlNr0hg1JK4FOcCYSORvZ-hH-Xcqd7srr-UVnFw&oe=69F1FC4E"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "JOb INterview Simulator (4).png", "id": "371985591479423", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035469_371985598146089_1320847157226308449_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=YlThww--RCUQ7kNvwFIFc_h&_nc_oc=AdrQZlkjhPiWc_pYj_BeDgkwyxmEg1f2M00w_ipL273sCIseek7JYTKuxwwlReft7bU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-3.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af03760MV5vGSp3eCzyCtS4WfizS_BjN3GR-ftM64LB69Q&oe=69F1FBD0"}, "display_name": "Job Interview Simulator", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Proficient job interviewing craft is vital to attain the careers of our dreams. Unfortunately, it's difficult to practice this skill in a realistic way.\n\nThat's why we built the Job Interview Simulator. Simulate the entire interviewing process; from emailing HR before the interview, picking an outfit, arriving on time, catching the elevator, greeting the receptionist, and acing the interview. \n\nFeel the situational pressure of a Job Interview in an immersive virtual environent, and refine your interviewing craft with automated feedback. \n", "short_description": "Simulate the experience of a Job Interview in Virtual Reality. Practice and hone your interviewing craft in a safe setting, so you can ace your next job interview!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.workwindow.com.au/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.workwindow.com.au/terms-and-conditions", "publisher_name": "Work Window ", "support_website_url": "https://support.workwindow.com.au/en", "webs